  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Electric Push Rod includes an electric linear actuator and a control cable. Connect the actuator to the Remote Control Receiver Shield 's servo interface using the included cable to control its extension and retraction. With its ultra-compact size and sleek silver-white design, it's perfect for CyberBrick miniature engineering models, serving as a realistic substitute for hydraulic cylinders and similar components. Ideal for any application requiring stable, precise linear motion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Servo Ports Pin Definition"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Please strictly follow the wire sequence below to avoid damaging the components.​"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Compatibility Notice for the New Electric Push Rod (PG003):"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "To ensure compatibility with the new Electric Push Rod (PG003), please update your CyberBrick mobile app to version v1.3.0 or above, or update the desktop client to version v1.0.0 or above before use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The CyberBrick Electric Push Rod (PG003) is not compatible with previous or other models (LA010/LA011) and must not be mixed or used interchangeably with them."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: left; padding-left: 12px;\">Introduction</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Electric Push Rod includes an electric linear actuator and a control cable. Connect the actuator to the <a href=\"../../../products/remote-control-receiver-shield-1pcs\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>Remote Control Receiver Shield</strong></span></a>'s servo interface using the included cable to control its extension and retraction. With its ultra-compact size and sleek silver-white design, it's perfect for CyberBrick miniature engineering models, serving as a realistic substitute for hydraulic cylinders and similar components. Ideal for any application requiring stable, precise linear motion.</p>\n<!--视频展示-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\">\n<p style=\"margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--video bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" controls=\"controls\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-=\"\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/44cd7bd29995437693ed3db5bac42a27/1.mp4\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\" style=\"width: 100%;\" width=\"300\"></video></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 并排的两张图片 -->\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; width: 100%;\"><!-- 左侧图片 -->\n<div style=\"width: 50%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px 10px 10px 0px;\"><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" controls=\"controls\" data-mce-=\"\" height=\"376\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" width=\"750\">\