  "description_text": "The Electric Push Rod includes an electric linear actuator and a control cable. Connect the actuator to the Remote Control Receiver Shield 's servo interface using the included cable to control its extension and retraction. With its ultra-compact size and sleek silver-white design, it's perfect for CyberBrick miniature engineering models, serving as a realistic substitute for hydraulic cylinders and similar components. Ideal for any application requiring stable, precise linear motion.\n\nPlease strictly follow the wire sequence below to avoid damaging the components.​\n\nTo ensure compatibility with the new Electric Push Rod (PG003), please update your CyberBrick mobile app to version v1.3.0 or above, or update the desktop client to version v1.0.0 or above before use.\n\nThe CyberBrick Electric Push Rod (PG003) is not compatible with previous or other models (LA010/LA011) and must not be mixed or used interchangeably with them.",
